" sizes="(max-width: 580px) 100vw, 580px" nitro-lazy-srcset="https://cdn-ileifea.nitrocdn.com/iPyOASfdsJWKFGsMcpWrFNEuPYjDaYld/assets/images/optimized/rev-06ec2d4/www.hijiffy.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/kora-logo-card.webp 580w, https://cdn-ileifea.nitrocdn.com/iPyOASfdsJWKFGsMcpWrFNEuPYjDaYld/assets/images/optimized/rev-06ec2d4/www.hijiffy.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/kora-logo-card-300x109.webp 300w" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-ileifea.nitrocdn.com/iPyOASfdsJWKFGsMcpWrFNEuPYjDaYld/assets/images/optimized/rev-06ec2d4/www.hijiffy.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/kora-logo-card.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-15077 nitro-lazy" decoding="async" /> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ba81c76 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="ba81c76" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Kora Living’s journey to 60% online check-ins, increased cross-selling, and automating 83% of guest queries</h3> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7b737ac elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7b737ac" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <p>“HiJiffy has allowed us to (&#8230;) have a 24-hour sales assistant that is operational and generates revenue, gives us metrics that help us to know our guests better and what they want to experience. Being a tool that works via API has allowed us to automate other processes such as automatic sending of WiFi codes, access to electronic lock keys during check-in, etc.”</p> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6121aec elementor-position-left elementor-vertical-align-middle elementor-position-left elementor-vertical-align-middle elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-id="6121aec" data-eleme