n a partnership.”</p> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3a729d55 elementor-position-left elementor-vertical-align-middle elementor-position-left elementor-vertical-align-middle elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-id="3a729d55" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image-box.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><img width="724" height="724" alt="Portobay fabiola new homepage [en]" sizes="(max-width: 724px) 100vw, 724px" nitro-lazy-srcset="https://cdn-ileifea.nitrocdn.com/iPyOASfdsJWKFGsMcpWrFNEuPYjDaYld/assets/images/optimized/rev-06ec2d4/www.hijiffy.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/portobay_fabiola.jpg 724w, https://cdn-ileifea.nitrocdn.com/iPyOASfdsJWKFGsMcpWrFNEuPYjDaYld/assets/images/optimized/rev-06ec2d4/www.hijiffy.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/portobay_fabiola-300x300.jpg 300w, https://cdn-ileifea.nitrocdn.com/iPyOASfdsJWKFGsMcpWrFNEuPYjDaYld/assets/images/optimized/rev-06ec2d4/www.hijiffy.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/portobay_fabiola-150x150.jpg 150w" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-ileifea.nitrocdn.com/iPyOASfdsJWKFGsMcpWrFNEuPYjDaYld/assets/images/optimized/rev-06ec2d4/www.hijiffy.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/portobay_fabiola.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-6600 nitro-lazy" decoding="async" /></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><div class="elementor-image-box-title">Fabíola Pereira</div><p class="elementor-image-box-description">Chief Marketing Officer</p></div></div> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-524d907a elementor-widget-mobile__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="524d907a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <div class="elementor-button-wrapper"> <a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="ht