ine check-ins by 200%<wbr /> using HiJiffy's AI</h3> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-188d0012 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="188d0012" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <p>“HiJiffy has enabled us to digitise and automate different processes in our hotels, allowing our teams to focus on what adds value to the customer experience (&#8230;) We can automatically attend to user queries on our website, with a degree of automation and satisfaction of 90%, helping to reduce the number of telephone calls we receive.”</p> </div> </div> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3956b552 elementor-position-left elementor-vertical-align-middle elementor-position-left elementor-vertical-align-middle elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-id="3956b552" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image-box.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><img width="300" height="300" alt="Raul new homepage [en]" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" nitro-lazy-srcset="https://cdn-ileifea.nitrocdn.com/iPyOASfdsJWKFGsMcpWrFNEuPYjDaYld/assets/images/optimized/rev-06ec2d4/www.hijiffy.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Raul.png 300w, https://cdn-ileifea.nitrocdn.com/iPyOASfdsJWKFGsMcpWrFNEuPYjDaYld/assets/images/optimized/rev-06ec2d4/www.hijiffy.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Raul-150x150.png 150w" nitro-lazy-src="https://cdn-ileifea.nitrocdn.com/iPyOASfdsJWKFGsMcpWrFNEuPYjDaYld/assets/images/optimized/rev-06ec2d4/www.hijiffy.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Raul.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-7707 nitro-lazy" decoding="async" /></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><div class="elementor-image-box-title">Raúl Amestoy</div><p class="elementor-image-box-description">Director of Sales &amp; Marketin